    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present Ti Lynch, Wardstown, Athboy to the market. This three bedroom detached house, the entire is located just outside Athboy and of the main Athboy to Navan main road. The property is situated on a mature site and his bounded by mature trees and hedging which provides additional privacy.\r\n\r\nThis property was recently fully refurbished by the current owner and it is set at the most beautiful countryside setting just outside the town of Athboy, not far from the Gaeltacht area of Rathcairn. The accommodation is set out with an entrance hall, two separate living rooms, open plan kitchen / dining room and a bathroom on the ground floor. The first floor consists of three spacious double bedrooms. To the rear of the property is a storage shed.\r\n\r\nLocated just 2km from the town of Athboy, 4.6km from the Gaeltacht village of Rathcairn, 15km from Navan, and just a 10 minute drive from junction 9 of the M3, this provides an ideal opportunity for families or commuters seeking a blend of countryside living and convenience."
      },
